sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Maker-checker payment approval drill-down
    accDescr: Illustrative dual-control payment approval sequence showing maker validation, independent checker review, mandate escalation, approval expiry, correction loops, rejection, and controlled release to execution.

    autonumber
    participant Maker
    participant Portal as Payment Portal
    participant Checker
    participant Approver as Additional Approver
    participant Execution as Execution Service

    loop Until the draft passes maker validation
        Maker->>Portal: Create or correct payment draft
        Portal->>Portal: Validate required fields and payment rules
        alt Validation fails
            Portal-->>Maker: Return required corrections
        else Validation passes
            Portal-->>Maker: Confirm draft can be submitted
        end
    end

    Maker->>Portal: Submit instruction and supporting information
    Portal->>Portal: Set status to pending approval
    alt Approval window expires
        Portal-->>Maker: Expire instruction and notify maker
    else Approval window remains open
        Portal->>Checker: Assign instruction to an eligible independent checker
        Checker->>Portal: Review instruction, support, and mandate
        alt Checker returns the instruction
            Portal-->>Maker: Return draft with review comments
        else Checker rejects the instruction
            Portal-->>Maker: Reject instruction and provide status
        else Checker approves within authority
            Portal->>Execution: Release approved instruction to execution queue
            Execution-->>Portal: Record controlled execution status
            Portal-->>Maker: Confirm instruction is ready for execution
        else Additional approval is required
            Portal->>Approver: Route instruction for additional approval
            Approver->>Portal: Review mandate and instruction
            alt Additional approver returns the instruction
                Portal-->>Maker: Return draft with review comments
            else Additional approver rejects the instruction
                Portal-->>Maker: Reject instruction and provide status
            else Additional approver approves
                Portal->>Execution: Release approved instruction to execution queue
                Execution-->>Portal: Record controlled execution status
                Portal-->>Maker: Confirm instruction is ready for execution
            end
        end
    end
